  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">HP-Rehabilitation and Reintegration Support for Abandoned Women</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In this project Koshish wants to work for the rehabilitation and support for abandoned women with mental health and psychosocial issues.  Specialized quality mental health and psychosocial support services are provided through the transit home included psychosocial counselling, psychiatric support, medication, proper nutrition, involvement in therapeutic and skill development activities, nursing and caring support in a healing environment.</narrative>
  </description>
